# Tests Postman pour Service CRUD Frappe/ERPNext

## Configuration générale

### Headers requis pour toutes les requêtes :
```
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
```

### Authentification :
- **Basic Auth** : Utilisez votre username/password ERPNext
- **Cookie** : Ou utilisez les cookies de session après connexion

---

## 1. 🆕 INSERT DOCUMENT

### URL :
```
POST http://erpnext.localhost:8000/api/method/hrms.services.frappe_document_service.api_insert_document
```

### Body (JSON) - Exemple Employee :
```json
{
    "doctype": "Employee",
    "field_values": {
        "first_name": "Jean",
        "last_name": "Rakoto",
        "employee_name": "Jean Rakoto",
        "company": "noufre society",
        "date_of_joining": "2024-01-15",
        "date_of_birth":"2005-01-15",
        "personal_email": "jean.rakoto@example.com",
        "cell_number": "+261 32 12 345 67",
        "gender": "Male",
        "status": "Active"
    },
    "submit_after_insert": true
}
```

### Body (JSON) - Exemple Customer :
```json
{
    "doctype": "Customer",
    "field_values": {
        "customer_name": "ACME Corporation",
        "customer_type": "Company",
        "customer_group": "Commercial",
        "territory": "Madagascar",
        "email_id": "contact@acme.com",
        "mobile_no": "+261 32 11 222 33"
    },
    "submit_after_insert": false
}
```

