## 2. 📖 EXTRACT INFO

### URL :
```
GET http://erpnext.localhost:8000/api/method/hrms.services.frappe_document_service.api_extract_info
```

### Paramètres URL - Champs spécifiques :
```
?doctype=Employee&name=HR-EMP-00001&fields=first_name,last_name,department,designation,company
```

### Paramètres URL - Tous les champs :
```
?doctype=Employee&name=HR-EMP-00001
```

### Exemple avec Customer :
```
?doctype=Customer&name=CUST-00001&fields=customer_name,customer_type,territory,email_id
```

