## 📋 Collection Postman complète

### Test 1 : Créer un Employee
```
POST http://erpnext.localhost:8000/api/method/hrms.services.frappe_document_service.api_insert_document

Headers:
- Content-Type: application/json

Body:
{
    "doctype": "Employee",
    "field_values": {
        "first_name": "Test",
        "last_name": "User",
        "employee_name": "Test User",
        "company": "Votre Société"
    }
}
```

### Test 2 : Lire les infos
```
GET http://erpnext.localhost:8000/api/method/hrms.services.frappe_document_service.api_extract_info?doctype=Employee&name=HR-EMP-XXXXX&fields=first_name,last_name,company
```

### Test 3 : Mettre à jour
```
POST http://erpnext.localhost:8000/api/method/hrms.services.frappe_document_service.api_update_document

Body:
{
    "doctype": "Employee",
    "name": "HR-EMP-XXXXX",
    "field_values": {
        "cell_number": "+261 32 12 345 67"
    }
}
```

### Test 4 : Supprimer
```
POST http://erpnext.localhost:8000/api/method/hrms.services.frappe_document_service.api_cancel_and_delete

Body:
{
    "doctype": "Employee",
    "name": "HR-EMP-XXXXX"
}
```

